n9e-mcp-server is derived from the Nightingale (n9e) MCP server
(module github.com/n9e/n9e-mcp-server). This tree keeps the stdio
entry and the read-only toolsets (alerts, targets, datasource,
busi_groups, metrics, logs). Write APIs, HTTP MCP mode, and unused
packages were removed.

Nightingale itself: https://github.com/ccfos/nightingale

